    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d636">

                <pb facs="0603" n="437" sameAs="frus:frus1917/pg437"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 837.156/228</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to
                        Minister Gonzales
                    </hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Telegram]</seg>
                </opener>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Department of State</hi>, <lb/>
                            <hi rendition="#italic">Washington</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1916-05-10T16:00:00-05:00">
                            <hi rendition="#italic">May 10, 1916, 4 p.m.</hi>
                        </date>
                    </dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>Your 319, March 24. Department unofficially informed that Ferrara has prepared
                    and submitted to other members of the commission, independent report on Cuban
                    Ports matter, showing various methods by which settlement might be reached.</p>
                <pb facs="0604" n="438" xml:id="pg438"/>
                <p>In view of time elapsed since date of decree, you may discreetly inquire as to
                    what progress has been made in this matter.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Lansing</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
